Ikib
$cards
DECK 4 {SPADES, HEARTS}

$initial
DRAW 51 DEAL COLUMN
COLUMN 4 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 7 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 0 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 6 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 9 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 8 FACE_HALF
